      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: GetSerialNumber (DataCollectionSteps = 3)\n\nControl: SerialNumber (UserControl, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout (427×262):\n• label1: \"Serial Number\" (3,9)\n• label2: \"Scan the serial number from the unit label\" (3,41)\n• tbSerialNumber: 271×20 at (6,57)\n• lblInvalidSerial: red, 367×59 at (3,80) — hidden unless error\n• label3 + listBox1: Sample Serial #'s (debug only, config EnableDebuggingHelpers)\n\nKey Properties:\n• GetInput() → ParseSerialFrom2DIf2DFound(tbSerialNumber.Text)\n• FASCell property (populated from serial lookup)\n• IsValid → complex validation per variation\n\nOn Next:\n1. Save ScannedSerialNumber + FASCell to current skid\n2. Combo skid: same logic (index 0 or 1)\n3. BoxLabel variation: skips to GetSkidIdFromLicensePlate (12)\n4. Advance → GetPalletQuantity (4)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: GetSerialNumber (DataCollectionSteps = 3)\n\nControl: SerialNumber (UserControl, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout (427×262):\n• label1: \"Serial Number\" (3,9)\n• label2: \"Scan the serial number from the unit label\" (3,41)\n• tbSerialNumber: 271×20 at (6,57)\n• lblInvalidSerial: red, 367×59 at (3,80) — hidden unless error\n• label3 + listBox1: Sample Serial #'s (debug only, config EnableDebuggingHelpers)\n\nKey Properties:\n• GetInput() → ParseSerialFrom2DIf2DFound(tbSerialNumber.Text)\n• FASCell property (populated from serial lookup)\n• IsValid → complex validation per variation\n\nOn Next:\n1. Save ScannedSerialNumber + FASCell to current skid\n2. Combo skid: same logic (index 0 or 1)\n3. BoxLabel variation: skips to GetSkidIdFromLicensePlate (12)\n4. Advance → GetPalletQuantity (4)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-variations",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1023,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Variation-specific validation (in IsValid):\n\n• BoxLabel: any serial allowed (even blank)\n• StandardReprint: must exist in DB; strips leading 'S'/'s'; validates via PalletInfoController.SkidIdIsFound_StandardReprint()\n• LowVolume: duplicate serial check + FAS Cell required + Julian date warning (>1 day old → confirm dialog)\n• Standard/Combo: duplicate serial check within combo; FAS Cell required\n\nFAS Cell populated via GetFASCellFromSerial() — extracts Production Line Code from serial",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Variation-specific validation (in IsValid):\n\n• BoxLabel: any serial allowed (even blank)\n• StandardReprint: must exist in DB; strips leading 'S'/'s'; validates via PalletInfoController.SkidIdIsFound_StandardReprint()\n• LowVolume: duplicate serial check + FAS Cell required + Julian date warning (>1 day old → confirm dialog)\n• Standard/Combo: duplicate serial check within combo; FAS Cell required\n\nFAS Cell populated via GetFASCellFromSerial() — extracts Production Line Code from serial",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
